Not dependencies
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

omniORB (LGPL/GPL), ACE/TAO (DOC License) and JacORB (LGPL) are used only as
interoperability test fixtures and conformance oracles: separate processes
reached over TCP using the published GIOP specification, and external programs
whose text output is read. No part of them is imported, linked, vendored or
redistributed, and `cargo tree` does not contain them.
